{
  "annotations": {
    "list": [
      {
        "builtIn": 1,
        "datasource": "-- Grafana --",
        "enable": true,
        "hide": true,
        "iconColor": "rgba(0, 211, 255, 1)",
        "name": "Annotations & Alerts",
        "type": "dashboard"
      },
      {
        "name": "Airflow task failures",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "${datasource}"
        },
        "enable": true,
        "iconColor": "red",
        "expr": "changes(airflow_ti_failures[1m]) > 0",
        "titleFormat": "Airflow task failure",
        "tagKeys": "dag,task",
        "step": "1m"
      }
    ]
  },
  "editable": true,
  "fiscalYearStartMonth": 0,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "id": null,
  "uid": "lab08-overview",
  "title": "Lab08 — Overview",
  "tags": [
    "lab08",
    "spark",
    "airflow",
    "minio",
    "hudi"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 4,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-1h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "timepicker": {},
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "datasource",
        "type": "datasource",
        "query": "prometheus",
        "current": {
          "text": "Prometheus",
          "value": "Prometheus"
        },
        "hide": 0
      },
      {
        "name": "layer",
        "label": "Layer",
        "description": "Виртуальный фильтр по слою lakehouse. ⚠️ Все слои работают на Spark, но через разные процессы:\n• Bronze — отдельные SparkApplication-ы (bronze-s3-streaming, bronze-kafka-ingest), запускаемые spark-operator-ом\n• Silver / Gold — dbt-модели, исполняются через долгоживущий Spark Thrift Server (spark_app_name=spark-thrift-server)\nПоэтому при выборе Silver или Gold в Spark-панелях вы видите ОДИН и тот же Thrift driver — слои разделяются на уровне Airflow задач ($layer_task), а не на уровне Spark процесса.",
        "type": "custom",
        "query": "All : .*,Bronze : bronze-.*,Silver : spark-thrift-server,Gold : spark-thrift-server",
        "options": [
          {
            "selected": true,
            "text": "All",
            "value": ".*"
          },
          {
            "selected": false,
            "text": "Bronze",
            "value": "bronze-.*"
          },
          {
            "selected": false,
            "text": "Silver",
            "value": "spark-thrift-server"
          },
          {
            "selected": false,
            "text": "Gold",
            "value": "spark-thrift-server"
          }
        ],
        "current": {
          "text": "All",
          "value": ".*"
        },
        "includeAll": false,
        "multi": false,
        "hide": 0
      },
      {
        "name": "layer_task",
        "label": "Layer task regex",
        "description": "Airflow task regex, синхронный с $layer. Для каждого слоя — свой набор task из transactions_pipeline DAG.",
        "type": "custom",
        "query": "All : .*,Bronze : wait_bronze.*,Silver : dbt_silver,Gold : dbt_gold|dbt_test",
        "options": [
          {
            "selected": true,
            "text": "All",
            "value": ".*"
          },
          {
            "selected": false,
            "text": "Bronze",
            "value": "wait_bronze.*"
          },
          {
            "selected": false,
            "text": "Silver",
            "value": "dbt_silver"
          },
          {
            "selected": false,
            "text": "Gold",
            "value": "dbt_gold|dbt_test"
          }
        ],
        "current": {
          "text": "All",
          "value": ".*"
        },
        "includeAll": false,
        "multi": false,
        "hide": 0
      },
      {
        "name": "spark_app",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "${datasource}"
        },
        "query": "label_values(up{spark_app_name=~\"$layer\", spark_app_name!=\"\"}, spark_app_name)",
        "refresh": 2,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "multi": true,
        "current": {
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all"
        },
        "label": "Spark App",
        "description": "Список Spark-драйверов, экспортирующих метрики через Prometheus servlet (port 4040). Сейчас здесь будут до 3 значений:\n• bronze-s3-streaming — Structured Streaming SparkApplication (bronze слой)\n• bronze-kafka-ingest — Structured Streaming SparkApplication (bronze слой)\n• spark-thrift-server — общий долгоживущий Spark driver, на котором dbt выполняет МОДЕЛИ silver и gold слоёв\nЕсли выбран Silver или Gold в $layer — здесь автоматически останется только spark-thrift-server."
      },
      {
        "name": "dag",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "${datasource}"
        },
        "query": "label_values(airflow_dagrun_duration_success, dag)",
        "refresh": 2,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "multi": true,
        "current": {
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all"
        },
        "label": "DAG"
      },
      {
        "name": "task",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "${datasource}"
        },
        "query": "label_values(airflow_task_duration{dag=~\"$dag\", task=~\"$layer_task\"}, task)",
        "refresh": 2,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "multi": true,
        "current": {
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all"
        },
        "label": "Task"
      },
      {
        "name": "bucket",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "${datasource}"
        },
        "query": "label_values(minio_bucket_usage_total_bytes, bucket)",
        "refresh": 2,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "multi": true,
        "current": {
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all"
        },
        "label": "MinIO Bucket"
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "row",
      "id": 100,
      "title": "Pipeline health  —  $layer",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "id": 1,
      "title": "Spark drivers up",
      "description": "count(up{spark_app_name=~\"$layer\", spark_app_name!=\"\"} == 1) — считаем только реальные Spark-драйверы (есть label spark_app_name). Без spark_app_name!=\"\" в подсчёт попадали бы все остальные up-цели кластера (apiserver, kubelet, minio, …) — у них spark_app_name отсутствует, а regex .* матчит и пустую строку. Зелёный = есть хотя бы один живой driver в выбранном слое, красный = ни одного.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "count(up{spark_app_name=~\"$layer\", spark_app_name!=\"\"} == 1)",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "id": 2,
      "title": "Airflow scheduler heartbeat / min",
      "description": "rate(airflow_scheduler_heartbeat[5m]) * 60. Норма >=10. <5 = шедулер деградирует. Не зависит от $layer (общий компонент).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "rate(airflow_scheduler_heartbeat[5m]) * 60",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "beats/min"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "colorMode": "value"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 5
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 10
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 6,
        "y": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "id": 3,
      "title": "Failures total (5m)",
      "description": "Сумма Airflow ti_failures + Spark Operator app failures за 5 минут. Один индикатор «есть ли инциденты». 0 = тишина, >=5 = инцидент. Аннотации failures видны на всех time series.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "(sum(increase(airflow_ti_finish{state=\"failed\", task=~\"$layer_task\"}[5m])) or vector(0)) + (sum(increase(spark_application_failure_count[5m])) or vector(0))",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "colorMode": "value"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 1
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 5
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "id": 4,
      "title": "MinIO drives online %",
      "description": "sum(online)/sum(total)*100. 100 норма. <80 = тенант degraded.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(minio_cluster_drive_online_total{job=\"minio\"}) / sum(minio_cluster_drive_total{job=\"minio\"}) * 100",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "colorMode": "value"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 100,
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 80
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 99
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 18,
        "y": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "id": 200,
      "title": "Spark  ($layer · $spark_app)  —  RED",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "id": 10,
      "title": "Throughput — streaming input rows/s",
      "description": "RATE. metrics_spark_driver_spark_streaming_<query>_inputRate_total_Value. Плоско в 0 при активном источнике = streaming остановился. Для silver/gold (Thrift) метрики не будет — это нормально.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (spark_app_name) (max by (spark_app_name, __name__) ({__name__=~\"metrics_spark_driver_spark_streaming_.+_inputRate_total_Value\", spark_app_name=~\"$spark_app\"}))",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "{{spark_app_name}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "rps"
        }
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 6
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "right",
          "showLegend": true,
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "mean",
            "max"
          ],
          "sortBy": "Last *",
          "sortDesc": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "id": 12,
      "title": "Saturation — JVM heap % + GC time %",
      "description": "Левая ось — driver heap (%, threshold lines 75/90). Правая ось — доля времени в GC (% wall clock, сумма по всем известным GC-пулам: Copy/MarkSweepCompact, PS, G1; недостающие пулы fallback в 0 чтобы суммирование не схлопывалось до пустого вектора). Heap >90 длительно или GC >5 = риск OOM/деградации throughput.\n\nNB: select `{__name__=~\".+_time_Value\"}` + rate() приводит к invalid vector (rate() strips __name__ → пулы Copy и MarkSweepCompact становятся идентичными labelset-ами и aggregator падает с \"vector cannot contain metrics with the same labelset\"). Поэтому каждый пул считаем отдельным rate() и суммируем явно.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "100 * max by (spark_app_name) (metrics_spark_driver_jvm_heap_used_Value{spark_app_name=~\"$spark_app\"}) / max by (spark_app_name) (metrics_spark_driver_jvm_heap_max_Value{spark_app_name=~\"$spark_app\"})",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "heap % · {{spark_app_name}}"
        },
        {
          "expr": "100 * (\n  (sum by (spark_app_name) (rate(metrics_spark_driver_jvm_Copy_time_Value{spark_app_name=~\"$spark_app\"}[1m]))                  or sum by (spark_app_name) (metrics_spark_driver_jvm_heap_used_Value{spark_app_name=~\"$spark_app\"} * 0))\n+ (sum by (spark_app_name) (rate(metrics_spark_driver_jvm_MarkSweepCompact_time_Value{spark_app_name=~\"$spark_app\"}[1m]))       or sum by (spark_app_name) (metrics_spark_driver_jvm_heap_used_Value{spark_app_name=~\"$spark_app\"} * 0))\n+ (sum by (spark_app_name) (rate(metrics_spark_driver_jvm_PS_Scavenge_time_Value{spark_app_name=~\"$spark_app\"}[1m]))            or sum by (spark_app_name) (metrics_spark_driver_jvm_heap_used_Value{spark_app_name=~\"$spark_app\"} * 0))\n+ (sum by (spark_app_name) (rate(metrics_spark_driver_jvm_PS_MarkSweep_time_Value{spark_app_name=~\"$spark_app\"}[1m]))           or sum by (spark_app_name) (metrics_spark_driver_jvm_heap_used_Value{spark_app_name=~\"$spark_app\"} * 0))\n+ (sum by (spark_app_name) (rate(metrics_spark_driver_jvm_G1_Young_Generation_time_Value{spark_app_name=~\"$spark_app\"}[1m]))    or sum by (spark_app_name) (metrics_spark_driver_jvm_heap_used_Value{spark_app_name=~\"$spark_app\"} * 0))\n+ (sum by (spark_app_name) (rate(metrics_spark_driver_jvm_G1_Old_Generation_time_Value{spark_app_name=~\"$spark_app\"}[1m]))      or sum by (spark_app_name) (metrics_spark_driver_jvm_heap_used_Value{spark_app_name=~\"$spark_app\"} * 0))\n) / 1000",
          "refId": "B",
          "legendFormat": "gc % · {{spark_app_name}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 100,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 75
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 90
              }
            ]
          },
          "custom": {
            "thresholdsStyle": {
              "mode": "line"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byRegexp",
              "options": "gc %.*"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "custom.axisPlacement",
                "value": "right"
              },
              {
                "id": "custom.axisLabel",
                "value": "GC time (% wall clock)"
              },
              {
                "id": "max",
                "value": 20
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byRegexp",
              "options": "heap %.*"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "custom.axisLabel",
                "value": "JVM heap used (%)"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 6
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "right",
          "showLegend": true,
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "mean",
            "max"
          ],
          "sortBy": "Last *",
          "sortDesc": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "id": 250,
      "title": "Spark deep dive (open if investigating)",
      "collapsed": true,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 14
      },
      "panels": [
        {
          "type": "timeseries",
          "id": 251,
          "title": "Latency — batch (ms) + Hudi commit p95 (s)",
          "description": "DURATION. Левая ось: Spark micro-batch latency. Правая ось: Hudi commit/deltacommit p95. Скачок одной без другой подсказывает где затык.",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "targets": [
            {
              "expr": "max by (spark_app_name) ({__name__=~\"metrics_spark_driver_spark_streaming_.+_latency_Value\", spark_app_name=~\"$spark_app\"})",
              "refId": "A",
              "legendFormat": "batch ms · {{spark_app_name}}"
            },
            {
              "expr": "max by (spark_app_name, __name__) ({__name__=~\"hudi_.+_(commit|deltacommit|clustering)_timer\", quantile=\"0.95\", spark_app_name=~\"$spark_app\"}) / 1e9",
              "refId": "B",
              "legendFormat": "hudi p95 s · {{spark_app_name}} / {{__name__}}"
            }
          ],
          "fieldConfig": {
            "defaults": {
              "unit": "ms"
            },
            "overrides": [
              {
                "matcher": {
                  "id": "byRegexp",
                  "options": "hudi p95.*"
                },
                "properties": [
                  {
                    "id": "unit",
                    "value": "s"
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "custom.axisPlacement",
                    "value": "right"
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "custom.axisLabel",
                    "value": "Hudi commit p95 (s)"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "matcher": {
                  "id": "byRegexp",
                  "options": "batch ms.*"
                },
                "properties": [
                  {
                    "id": "custom.axisLabel",
                    "value": "Batch latency (ms)"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          "gridPos": {
            "h": 7,
            "w": 12,
            "x": 0,
            "y": 15
          },
          "options": {
            "legend": {
              "displayMode": "table",
              "placement": "right",
              "showLegend": true,
              "calcs": [
                "lastNotNull",
                "mean",
                "max"
              ],
              "sortBy": "Last *",
              "sortDesc": true
            },
            "tooltip": {
              "mode": "multi",
              "sort": "desc"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "timeseries",
          "id": 252,
          "title": "Live executors (running pods)",
          "description": "Количество Running executor-pod-ов в namespace spark-jobs, сгруппированных по spark_app_name. Лейбл извлекается из имени pod через label_replace (kube-state-metrics не экспортирует кастомные pod labels по умолчанию). Падение до 0 при активном streaming = драйвер потерял executors.",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "targets": [
            {
              "refId": "A",
              "legendFormat": "{{spark_app_name}}",
              "expr": "count by (spark_app_name) (label_replace(kube_pod_status_phase{namespace=\"spark-jobs\", phase=\"Running\", pod=~\".+-[a-f0-9]{16}-exec-.+\"} == 1, \"spark_app_name\", \"$1\", \"pod\", \"(.+)-[a-f0-9]{16}-exec-.+\"))"
            },
            {
              "refId": "B",
              "legendFormat": "{{spark_app_name}}",
              "expr": "count by (spark_app_name) (label_replace(kube_pod_status_phase{namespace=\"spark-jobs\", phase=\"Running\", pod=~\"spark-thrift-exec-.+\"} == 1, \"spark_app_name\", \"spark-thrift-server\", \"pod\", \".*\"))"
            }
          ],
          "fieldConfig": {
            "defaults": {
              "unit": "short"
            }
          },
          "gridPos": {
            "h": 7,
            "w": 12,
            "x": 12,
            "y": 15
          },
          "options": {
            "legend": {
              "displayMode": "table",
              "placement": "right",
              "showLegend": true,
              "calcs": [
                "lastNotNull",
                "min",
                "max"
              ],
              "sortBy": "Last *",
              "sortDesc": true
            },
            "tooltip": {
              "mode": "multi",
              "sort": "desc"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "timeseries",
          "id": 253,
          "title": "Spark write activity (jobs/min, failed stages)",
          "description": "Spark DAGScheduler write activity: jobs/min (rate allJobs) + кумулятивные failed stages. Источник наблюдаемости write-пути для Hudi таблиц (нативный Hudi PROMETHEUS reporter выключен из-за несовместимости bundle 1.1.1 со стандартным simpleclient_dropwizard — см. lab08/OBSERVABILITY_PLAN.md → Known issues). DAGScheduler метрики публикуются Spark-нативно через PrometheusServlet на порту 4040. Растущий jobs/min = streaming активно коммитит micro-batches; failedStages > 0 — стейджи падают.",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "targets": [
            {
              "refId": "A",
              "legendFormat": "jobs/min · {{spark_app_name}}",
              "expr": "60 * sum by (spark_app_name) (max by (spark_app_name) (rate(metrics_spark_driver_DAGScheduler_job_allJobs_Value{spark_app_name=~\"$spark_app\"}[1m])))"
            },
            {
              "refId": "B",
              "legendFormat": "failed stages · {{spark_app_name}}",
              "expr": "sum by (spark_app_name) (max by (spark_app_name) (metrics_spark_driver_DAGScheduler_stage_failedStages_Value{spark_app_name=~\"$spark_app\"}))"
            }
          ],
          "fieldConfig": {
            "defaults": {
              "unit": "short"
            },
            "overrides": [
              {
                "matcher": {
                  "id": "byRegexp",
                  "options": "failed stages.*"
                },
                "properties": [
                  {
                    "id": "color",
                    "value": {
                      "mode": "fixed",
                      "fixedColor": "red"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "custom.axisPlacement",
                    "value": "right"
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "custom.axisLabel",
                    "value": "failed stages (cum)"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "matcher": {
                  "id": "byRegexp",
                  "options": "jobs/min.*"
                },
                "properties": [
                  {
                    "id": "custom.axisLabel",
                    "value": "jobs / min"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          "gridPos": {
            "h": 7,
            "w": 12,
            "x": 0,
            "y": 22
          },
          "options": {
            "legend": {
              "displayMode": "table",
              "placement": "right",
              "showLegend": true,
              "calcs": [
                "lastNotNull",
                "max"
              ],
              "sortBy": "Last *",
              "sortDesc": true
            },
            "tooltip": {
              "mode": "multi",
              "sort": "desc"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
